  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "山路ê光景"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">徛踮『塔塔加鞍部』入山口石碑ê頭前，阮有先hip相做記念，煞tsiah起行。遠遠青翠ê山崙重重疊疊，規天清清無風無搖，正是peh山ê好流擺。無kài闊ê塗路，se̍h來se̍h去lóng是菅芒、雜草，無樹ńg thang遮日，一睏仔久就滿身重汗、衫褲總tâm。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我看著四箍圍仔ê低樹欉、花草有tsiânn濟蟲thuā、尾蝶仔，kap五花十色ê野鳥leh tiô來tiô去，鏡頭就tshia̍k tshia̍k tshia̍k，hip kah bē得thang煞。Koh起行ê時，路邊青翠ê塗壁，連suà有一寡tsiânn罕見，大細lóng無仝ê野菇、菌欉，外形ê色水，有素面--ê，也有豔kah比花koh-khah suí--ê。我就jîm銀角仔起來囥踮菇柄邊做pān仔，對坦邊、頂下隨張仔hip。料bē到，tìng意--ê愈來愈濟，就án-ne tsia thōng hia tshiân，kiōng-beh tuè bē著陣。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">沿路有tsiok濟早to lian--去ê玉山杜鵑，m̄-koh ue頂iáu有結規phiàn青青長長ê m̂，應該是未開葉ê新ínn，tiâu tī枝尾sìm--一-下sìm--一-下。Iah若tng-leh開粉紅仔色--ê，是另外一種細細蕊仔，葉khah幼ê kuân山杜鵑。規山坪ê雜草仔內底，開kah上tshia-iānn--ê是規tshok淺紅lām白ê繡線菊，頂頭有尾蝶仔kap山蜂leh tsn̄g來tsn̄g去，連我hip相ê人mā看kah目睭起花，無想beh徙跤。路邊比人khah kuân ê箭竹愈來愈旺，suà手at一枝新筍來bóng哺，hit款白tsiánn koh生甜ê口味，到tann hōo人siàu念bē煞。過南峰ê三叉路了後，有徛一塊「鐵杉」ê柴牌仔，tsiah知影tsit種lò跤、粗皮ê大樹仔，kan-na用根盤釘tī石坎，親像lán台灣人m̄認輸ê硬氣hit一樣，hōo我看kah lóng神--去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsîng入山ê路喙行到排雲山莊止，khah大面是勻勻仔起崎ê塗路，總tshé iáu有兩米闊，khah狹--ê是用tsām仔tī徛thîng ê石壁硬拍--出-來ê山路，就khah無一米--ah，頂頭有釘規tsuā ê鐵鍊仔hōo人huānn，一半搭仔khah歹過路，m̄-koh lóng無kài長。頭尾八公里半，碰著82座鐵架鋪柴枋ê棧橋，看--起-來lóng有照起工leh保養ê款，好行koh sù-sī。上尾賰差不多100米遠ê時tsūn，若m̄是講ē-tàng聽著山莊厝頂ê國旗仔飛kah pho̍k-pho̍k叫，親像leh huah-hiu眾人ài koh拚--落-去，bē-sái停睏，實在講，早to跤痠手軟無想beh行--ah。Thìng候liòng起去上尾坎，踏起去平thánn門埕ê hit時tsūn，揹tī肩胛頭ê mi̍h件bē輸無影跡--去仝款，緊mé倚去桌仔邊，kha-tshng kap行李做伙頓落去椅liâu，帽仔採--落-來，ná ia̍t ná拭汗，連喘幾若个大心khuì。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/YVj6jO\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/YVj6jO</a>）</p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhkQoTX2fXSKZzfzwfPXslLvFa6KWzAyHw7r86U3-iVZLNSr841VF1lxVIyJAHD7FgLln8o3iPj6HipY1DJ15ojWyM41hiCUI3_ro9oWP2FBSo_xyv90l7dSzLQGo_tPtVJrzBod1fRgfRJovgN6fSPsjOrlRKle1v-qFEt5VA_I3AvbgfEzW3ws4ngsC1R/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1358%E6%9C%9F_8.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhkQoTX2fXSKZzfzwfPXslLvFa6KWzAyHw7r86U3-iVZLNSr841VF1lxVIyJAHD7FgLln8o3iPj6HipY1DJ15ojWyM41hiCUI3_ro9oWP2FBSo_xyv90l7dSzLQGo_tPtVJrzBod1fRgfRJovgN6fSPsjOrlRKle1v-qFEt5VA_I3AvbgfEzW3ws4ngsC1R/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1358%E6%9C%9F_8.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgOWbLHQX2JtMb6j7iqC99W2akCr1Os5YWjzp-sx-kHcKzWiBzKAGvggxmEBfIF75XGsvqcOv4sufgR7V_ehdbazjpzlM51i6xz1Zxp6hxPd46X2sn2BZdvX4SwSrVDu7wD58PYP4PSndNAhb5LEaFA0nHRc4t6i4KWhTVcTLzK6dB9qjlqz1Ub6R8F7uJK/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1358%E6%9C%9F_9.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1